# Start by excluding everything, then re-include only the two app folders.
# Keeps the build context tiny and free of the other projects in this repo.
*

!hafsum-react
!hafsum-server

# Never copy these into the image (reinstalled/rebuilt in the Dockerfile).
hafsum-react/node_modules
hafsum-server/node_modules
hafsum-react/dist

# Secrets & customer data must never be baked into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/db.json
**/db.corrupt-*.json
